<title>USA: Hussey copper price drops to 122 cents/lb July 30.</title>
<headline>Hussey copper price drops to 122 cents/lb July 30.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hussey Copper Ltd said its contained copper price was down ten cents to 122.00 cents per lb. effective with shipments of July 30. ((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
